# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — CAMPUS CUPID
## Full-Stack Campus Dating, Matchmaking & Community Voting Web Application

You are an expert full-stack software engineer, product designer, database architect and security engineer.

Your task is to design, develop, test and deploy a fully functional, production-ready, mobile-first campus dating and matchmaking web application called **Campus Cupid**.

This is not a static UI prototype. Every button, form, filter, swipe, authentication flow, database operation, matching function, voting mechanism and administrative feature must work.

The platform is designed for a closed university ecosystem consisting of approximately 1,000 students across six institutes.

The entire application should be designed to operate on free-tier infrastructure wherever technically possible.

Do not introduce paid services, paid APIs, paid subscriptions or billing requirements without explicitly informing me first.

