# PART 1 — CORE PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS

## 1. Product overview

Build a campus-exclusive dating web application accessible through a public URL.

Students will access it through a link shared on an existing college Instagram page.

The application must work seamlessly on:
- Android mobile browsers.
- iPhone Safari.
- Desktop browsers.
- Tablets.

It should behave like a lightweight mobile dating application, with a bottom navigation bar, swipe interactions, responsive cards and minimal loading times.

